WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Narrator: Watch the whole hold.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.100
Narrator: The instruction comes by radio, and Noura reads it back.

3
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.400
Radio: Marshal 22, Stop and Hold at Gate 4 stair head. Station platform full. Over.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.400
Noura: Stop and Hold at Gate 4 stair head. Copy.

5
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:20.700
Narrator: She and Faisal step to the hold line - stop, then hold. She tells the fans why.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.800
Noura: Please wait here a moment - the station is full. It's for your safety.

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.900
Narrator: From above, you can see the space ahead clearing, while the crowd behind grows - so she reports it.

8
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:44.500
Noura: Sierra 2, Marshal 22. Hold in place at Gate 4 stair head. Crowd calm. Building at the back of the concourse. Over.

9
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.500
Radio: Release gradually. Over.

10
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.000
Noura: Walk, please.

11
00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.600
Narrator: When the release comes, she lets people go gradually.

